Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:00:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] paint: background-clip: text on inline elements

A gradient word inside a heading (<h1>One engine. <span class=grad>No Chrome.</span></h1>) was
not painted: inline elements only got background-color, per glyph run. For each inline element
with background-clip: text, paint its background layers over the box that covers its glyph runs,
then keep it only under those glyphs (DestIn). Limit: an element that wraps gets one box over
all its line fragments.
---
